# Indestructible skips destroyDamagedCreatures' deathtouch branch exactly
# the same way it skips the toughness one (action.go's guard runs before
# either check) -- CR 702.2c's "any nonzero deathtouch damage is lethal"
# never gets the chance to apply. Spearbreaker Behemoth (5/5, Indestructible)
# blocks Typhoid Rats (1/1, Deathtouch) and survives its single point of
# deathtouch damage; the Behemoth's own 5 power is ordinary-lethal to the
# Rats' 1 toughness regardless.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks 2=1
declareblockers
advance
advance
combatdamage
advance
